12. biological distributed nervous systems.

The research question is not:

> "Did KRYLO invent distributed cognition?"

The question is:

> **Does the specific combination of persistent attributed pathway state, governed Formation capture, Formation Frontier detection, and frontier-directed heterogeneous processing provide a materially useful capability not supplied by the constituent prior-art primitives alone?**

